 [{:id :nlab-condition-1,
   :statement
   "The Yoneda embedding for C a locally small category is the functor Y : C [C^op, Set] from C to the category of presheaves over C which is the image of the hom-functor Hom : C^op C Set under the Hom adjunction Hom(C^op C , Set) Hom(C, [C^op, Set]) in the closed symmetric monoidal category Cat.",
   :refs
   [:locally-small-category
    :functor
    :hom-functor
    :adjunction
    :monoidal-category
    :object
    :hom-set
    :morphism]}
  {:id :nlab-condition-2,
   :statement
   "Hence Y sends any object c C to the representable presheaf which assigns to any other object d of C the hom-set of morphisms from d into c: Y(c) \\;\\; C^op Set \\,.",
   :refs
   [:locally-small-category
    :functor
